cpp/language/qualified_lookup\">qualified lookup</a>, and can only be found by <a href=\"/w/cpp/language/adl\">argument-dependent lookup</a> when <code>adjacent_transform_view::<i>iterator</i>&lt;Const&gt;</code> is an associated class of the arguments.\n</p>\n<h3 id=\"Parameters\">Parameters</h3>\n<table class=\"t-par-begin\">\n<tr class=\"t-par\">\n<td> i, j\n</td>\n<td> -\n</td>\n<td> the <a href=\"/w/cpp/ranges/adjacent_transform_view/iterator\">iterators</a>\n</td></tr>\n<tr class=\"t-par\">\n<td> n\n</td>\n<td> -\n</td>\n<td> a position relative to current location\n</td></tr></table>\n<h3 id=\"Return_value\">Return value</h3>\n<div class=\"t-li1\"><span class=\"t-li\">1,2)</span> An incremented iterator.</div>\n<div class=\"t-li1\"><span class=\"t-li\">3)</span> A decremented iterator.</div>\n<div class=\"t-li1\"><span class=\"t-li\">4)</span> A distance between given iterators.</div>\n<h3 id=\"Example\">Example</h3>\n<div class=\"t-notice\">This section is incomplete<br>Reason: no example </div>\n<h3 id=\"See_also\">See also</h3>\n<table class=\"t-dsc-begin\">\n<tr class=\"t-dsc\">\n<td>  <div class=\"t-dsc-member-div\"><div><a href=\"/w/cpp/ranges/adjacent_transform_view/iterator/operator_arith\"> <span class=\"t-lines\"><span>operator++</span><span>operator++<span>(int)</span></span><span>operator--</span><span>operator--<span>(int)</span></span><span>operator+=</span><span>operator-=</span></span></a></div></div>\n</td>\n<td>  advances or decrements the underlying iterators <br> <span class=\"t-mark\">(public member function)</span> </td></tr>\n</table>","headings":[{"depth":3,"text":"Parameters","id":"Parameters"},{"depth":3,"text":"Return value","id":"Return_value"},{"depth":3,"text":"Example","id":"Example"},{"depth":3,"text":"See also","id":"See_also"}],"breadcrumbs":[{"path":"","title":"C++ reference"},{"path":"ranges","title":"Ranges library (since C++20)"},{"path":"ranges/adjacent_transform_view","title":"std::ranges::views::adjacent_transform, std